{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed Lair is a base building auto-battler roguelike where you place your buildings like in an inventory to create a powerful army of orcs, goblins and other monsters, then send them to defeat your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your buildings carefully </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building has its own power: Create minions, improve them or produce gold. After every wave, you will be able to buy new buildings from a random selection, dig your lair bigger or make room for new minions. Make the best choice to hold your enemies off long enough<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/fc35dd28bf634a21a744fd1ee6251aeb.poster.avif?t=1763410477\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/fc35dd28bf634a21a744fd1ee6251aeb.webm?t=1763410477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/fc35dd28bf634a21a744fd1ee6251aeb.mp4?t=1763410477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Let them fight </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an evil lord, you have a lot of enemies. See your minions resisting against a ever growing battalion of different heroes: elves, dwarves, humans, ... but nothing stops you from throwing spells then and there while your minions are fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/8e8c0dc0215b48c53d783dfd21b4673f.poster.avif?t=1763410477\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/8e8c0dc0215b48c53d783dfd21b4673f.webm?t=1763410477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/extras/8e8c0dc0215b48c53d783dfd21b4673f.mp4?t=1763410477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive and Thrive </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you crush your enemies or did they crush you first ? No problem, you can always start anew with better buildings and improvments. There is always a volcano somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489680?t=1763410477","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489680?t=1763410477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/93973d0fabba27cb5dde1460f492ebc5a0f03a4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763410477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489680/93973d0fabba27cb5dde1460f492ebc5a0f03a4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763410477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed Lair is a base building auto-battler roguelike where you place your buildings like in an inventory to create a powerful army of orcs, goblins and other monsters, then send them to defeat your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Place your buildings carefully </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building has its own power: Create minions, improve them or produce gold. After every wave, you will be able to buy new buildings from a random selection, dig your lair bigger or make room for new minions. Make the best choice to hold